    <rigor>STANDARD</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Creates a NEW Dataverse entity (`sprk_emailreviewlog`) — no BFF code, no Step 9.5 gates. STANDARD per §8 (new-surface schema creation with constraints). §11 Component Justification REQUIRED (new entity). Append-only semantics + machine-and-human-review-both-as-rows is the compliance differentiator (G-5); getting the shape wrong cascades into Job B apply (031). Verify-or-create: the operator may have pre-created it in parallel.</rigor-reason>
    <parallel-group>P1</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>New-entity authoring against a documented field spec — mechanical, no architectural judgment. Default execution tier at `medium` effort per §8.5 (schema/config).</model-tier-reason>
