    <patterns>
      <pattern name="Dataverse entity creation" location=".claude/skills/dataverse-create-schema/SKILL.md">
        Web API + PowerShell for entity + attribute + option-set creation. Verify conventions via MCP first; verify-or-create — reconcile an operator-pre-created entity rather than duplicating it.
